/ app-systems: every %!app.X% is the type X, and the plang path, the C# path and the file path say the same thing.
/ This goal is the branch's summary: each stage is a sub-goal, and its steps are the behaviour we want, each with the
/ test that validates it. Tests live at the path of what they test (never a branch or stage folder); checks that
/ can't be a .test.goal are in spec/checks.md. A stage is done when its tests pass, its checks hold, and its OBP review
/ is clean. The tests are built only when Ingi says so.
AppSystems
- call Stage8g          / done: validation that the modifiers-as-clauses logic works
- call Stage8h          / in progress: the builder builds itself, and words compile to what they mean
- call Stage9           / shape: each handler is one line to its owner (worklist + OBP review); one visible payoff
- call Stage10          / %!app holds its types; the app's facts are plang values
- call Stage11          / shape: C# tests reach the app through its own doors; one door to an actor
- call Stage12          / a programmer's mistake is an error result with its own key, never a crash

Stage8g
- each retry of an action gets a fresh deadline                  / Tests/Modules/On/Timeout/RetryGetsAFreshDeadline
- a recovery's result is never served from the cache             / Tests/Modules/On/Cache/RecoveryIsNeverCached
- %!data% after an action with a clause is the action's result   / Tests/Modules/On/DataIsLeftAloneAfterAClause

Stage8h
- "retry once" is one retry                                       / Tests/Modules/On/Error/RetryOnceMeansOneRetry
- "if %done%, return %x%" returns from inside the if              / Tests/Modules/Condition/If/IfReturnReturns
- render takes its arguments by name                              / Tests/Modules/Ui/Render/RenderTakesNamedArguments
- the builder rebuilds its own goals with no reader for the old format    / checks.md
- the decider asks stage 1's common questions, and the eval measures it  / checks.md

Stage9
- a value is born through its type, so "after file create" fires  / Tests/App/Type/File/CreateFiresOnBirth
- every existing test passes; each handler hands over in one line  / checks.md

Stage10
- the app lists its types                                         / Tests/App/Type/AppListsItsTypes
- a plugin's type joins the app                                   / Tests/App/Type/PluginTypeJoinsTheApp
- one name, one type: a plugin can't take a built-in's name       / Tests/App/Type/OneNameOneType
- the app's facts are plang values                                / Tests/App/AppFactsArePlangValues
- a typed list holds its type                                     / Tests/App/Type/List/TypedListHoldsItsType
- the app's name is its setting                                   / Tests/App/Setting/AppNameIsItsSetting

Stage11
- one door to an actor: %!app.actor.system%, not %!app.system%   / Tests/App/Actor/OneDoorToAnActor
- the builder warns about a goal nothing reaches                   / checks.md
- every C# test passes with TestApp and TestAction deleted         / checks.md

Stage12
- a value that takes no child is an error result                  / Tests/App/Type/Item/SetChildOnAValueIsAnError
- an unknown setting is an error result                           / Tests/App/Setting/UnknownSettingIsAnError
